# graphify's per-clone files: its cache and the state each `graphify update`
# rewrites. The graph outputs in graphify-out/ are tracked,
# .graphify_labels.json and its .sig included.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/.graphify_build_state.json
graphify-out/.graphify_labels.pending.json
# `graphify update` writes neither of these two. The graphify skill writes
# .graphify_python, the interpreter path it resolved on this host. The skill's
# full build and `graphify extract` add each run's token use to cost.json.
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/cost.json

